  "body": "### Description\n\nSynapse has been upgraded to 1.70.1, Element has been upgraded to 1.11.14 RC1.\r\n\"Allow a QR code to be shown in session manager to sign in another device\" is enabled in the lab.\r\nBut the QR code related functions are still not shown.\r\n![{C15CA667-78B7-5949-27F3-0A3F62211B78}](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/48104960/199299830-e9880a61-80e4-44cc-aa6a-9a16e2796159.png)\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nn/a\n\n### Homeserver\n\nSynapse 1.70.1\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n{\"server\":{\"name\":\"Synapse\",\"version\":\"1.70.1\"}}\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDocker (matrixdotorg/synapse)\n\n### Platform\n\nSynology DiskStation Manager 6.2.3.25426 (Linux Kernel 3.10.105 x64)\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nn/a\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n**I posted the same question on #synapse:matrix.org on 10/21/2022, but no reply until today.**\r\nhttps://matrix.to/#/!ehXvUhWNASUkSLvAGP:matrix.org/$acWryrcahb2x8yuJLpN_GvpiKgXAtE_XJYDfrUNt83U",
